  "verdict": "null_holds_under_convergence",
  "verdict_text": "P1 minus P2 is +0.0236 QWK and the patient-level CI includes zero in every condition (EyePACS-only, full test sets). The null reported in Section 3.3 survives full model convergence, so the provisional caveat in Section 3.5 can be discharged -- but report the power alongside it: this test resolves effects down to about 0.045 QWK, which rules out an inflation the size of Tampu et al.'s upper range (0.43) comfortably and their lower range (0.07) only marginally. A null without a minimum detectable effect is not interpretable.",
